    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 795,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 主要保存你已发送的输入，以及回看所需的来源信息；这并不意味着复制全部 AI 回复或所",
        "有文件。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-68e054397389",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.026",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 898.1,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 898.1,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
