    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 925.1,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "我需要把所有内容都整理好吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fbbc548f84cc",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 988.1,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不需要。阅读、找回、编辑和复制有用的话，本身就应该有价值。主题与可选的 AI 整理是增强能",
        "力，不是使用前提。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5738350082c0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.029",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 29,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1091.2,
