    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.030",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 30,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1118.2,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "全部档案都会被发送给 AI 吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-959dc5038307",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.031",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 31,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1181.2,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不会。普通档案使用以本地为先。外部 AI 处理和上下文复用是分别授权、明确触发的操作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dbd48596dae5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.032",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 32,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1256.25,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 1256.25,
