      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.033",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 33,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1283.25,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "现在可以在哪些平台上使用？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-0bbf52a58ad5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.034",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 34,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1346.25,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "当前邀请制内测为 Chrome 扩展，可在同意后捕获 ChatGPT 输入。其他平台、移动应用和外部 A",
        "I 读取连接器，不作为现在已可安装的能力承诺。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5d457501a24e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.035",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 35,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 1449.35,
