    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.036",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 36,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1476.35,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "有了聊天历史，为什么还需要它？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4a3a52baf411",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.037",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 37,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 1539.35,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 为你自己的话提供一个独立的工作层：回看、编辑、核对原话，再选择复用哪些内容。只使",
        "用一个 AI 产品，也可能有这样的需要。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-43a12da5dd60",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
