      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不是。捕获、受支持的历史导入和 PAIA 备份各有范围；内测产品不承诺完整恢复外部 AI 账号。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fe483e1c2850",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.044",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 44,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2000.5999999999997,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2000.5999999999997,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.045",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 45,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2027.5999999999997,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "本地优先意味着完全不联网吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4770789b9c2d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.046",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 46,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2090.5999999999995,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不意味着。官网需要在线托管，申请内测使用已说明的转发服务，外部 AI 也有独立的联网边界。",
        "本地优先并不是加密认证。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9d11af7f9458",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.047",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 47,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2193.7,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2193.7,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.048",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 48,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2220.7,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "我复制发送的文字，就是我的观点吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-92ae6b6a4b7e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.049",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 49,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2283.7,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不一定。它可能是引用、岗位描述、草稿、问题或角色扮演。PAIA 应保留这种区别，而不是据此",
        "编造个人画像。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c97f7ef31fd4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.050",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 50,
      "x1": 584,
      "y1": 2386.7999999999997,
      "x2": 1364,
      "y2": 2386.7999999999997,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.051",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 51,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2413.7999999999997,
      "width": 733,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "发给外部的内容，还能收回吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d0eb0ef60b44",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.052",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 52,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2476.7999999999997,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不能。PAIA 可以停止由它控制的后续提供，但不能收回已经发送到外部系统或导出的副本。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-aaf9ac84cd92",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.053",
      "kind": "line",
