      "font_size": 29,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "官网示例展示的是我的真实档案吗？"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ebd37bc6c22b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-zh-1440.055",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 55,
      "x": 584,
      "y": 2641.85,
      "width": 725,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "不是。示例使用虚构材料，不连接你的档案，也不调用实时 AI 模型。刷新会清除临时修改。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-e44b2b70eaf6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
